{"route":"/news-highlights/1284-pt-round-01,-2024-registration-form","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"PT round-01, 2024 Registration Form"}],"updated":"2024-04-12","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1284-pt-round-01,-2024-registration-form.html","title":"PT round-01, 2024 Registration Form","bodyHtml":"<p>IPC is going to conduct PT round 01, 2024 in<strong> pH &amp; Chromatographic Purity by HPLC</strong> in Chemical Discipline (Drugs &amp; Pharmaceuticals)<strong>. </strong></p>\n<p>You are requested to find the attached <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/library/books/Registration-Form_240410_185136.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Registration form</strong><span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a> and send your consent with filled registration form on e-mail at <a href=\"mailto:qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in\">qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in</a> on or before <strong>30th April 2024</strong>. </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Registration_Form.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Registration_Formjpg_Page1.jpg\" alt=\"Image: PT round-01, 2024 Registration Form\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>","date":"2024-04-10","category":"Announcements"}